    .string "I know who pays that.\p"
    .string "Do not look at me like that.\p"
    .string "If you want it back, go and get it\n"
    .string "after I have sold it.\p"
    .string "They keep things in the WAREHOUSE\n"
    .string "on FIVE ISLAND. The password I\l"
    .string "know is “Yes, nah, UPTIME.”\p"
    .string "I am telling you where I am going.\n"
    .string "That is not nothing.\p"
    .string "Do not think badly of me.$"

